BankTransactionAnalyzer.js:
Simulates a banking system to analyze deposits, withdrawals, and balances. Demonstrates transaction handling and conditional checks

Copy&Reference.js / Copy&Reference2.js:
Explains the difference between copying vs referencing objects in JavaScript. Useful for understanding shallow vs deep copies.

EmployeePayrollProcessor.js:
Processes employee payroll data. Includes salary calculation, deductions, and structured reporting.

ExamPortalSimulator.js:
Simulates an online exam portal with features like login, question handling, and result calculation

Library BookManagementSystem.js:
Manages library books (add, issue, return). Demonstrates CRUD operations on objects/arrays.

MovieStreamingPlatform.js:
Mimics a streaming platform with movie listings, subscriptions, and user interactions.

OTPCountdownSimulator(Console App).js:
Console-based OTP countdown timer. Demonstrates timers and asynchronous functions.

StudentPerformanceDashboard.js:
Tracks student marks and performance. Includes analytics like averages, grades, and ranking.

deepcopy.js / shallow.js:
Demonstrates deep copy vs shallow copy in JavaScript with examples

functions.js:
Practice file for modular functions and reusable code.

shoppingcart.js:
Simulates an e-commerce shopping cart with add/remove items and total calculation.


